## 2. Flagged sites

### HE3

**H5 — GENERAL-WITH-EDIT: false irreducible-implies-separable wording**

> “the norm is through the FIELD L″ — Φ″ irreducible makes the θ″ a full conjugate set — so no DVR-ness of O[x]/(Φ″) is consulted”

This is false in equal characteristic: an irreducible polynomial such as \(x^p-t\) has only one geometric root, with multiplicity \(p\). The needed identity remains valid as

\[
\operatorname{Res}(\Phi'',B_0)
=\operatorname{Nm}_{K_0[x]/(\Phi'')\,/\,K_0}(B_0\bmod \Phi''),
\]

where norm means the determinant norm and geometric roots are counted with algebraic multiplicity. Thus this is a proof-wording edit, not new mathematics and not an obstruction.

