> “A leaf ℓ is decided iff (a) the read TERMINATES with every TERMINAL residual polynomial separable — repeated residual roots are allowed at intermediate nodes”

The note does not silently infer separability of irreducible factors of \(f\); it assumes `disc(f) ≠ 0`. Intermediate inseparable residuals are explicitly part of the recursive read.

